  "description": "Bluepeak Credit Union skin of the vendor teller console: the sign-in button reads 'Log On', the posting button reads 'Authorize Posting', and a mandatory VERIFY TRANSFER interstitial sits between the transfer form and the confirm screen. Form name attributes, routes, and flow semantics are the base product's.",
  "hosts": [
